# For the script given-up: the Fortify menu and the capital's picker given up with Esc.
# Also Fortify with two armies in one city. May 1862, the Rebels play, with 1000 in cash: two
# forts (200 each) and a move of the capital (500).
date 5 1862
side 2
cash 300 1000
# Two Rebel armies, both in Richmond, city 33: J.E. Johnston's and Jackson's. The Fortify menu
# has one row for the city, not one for each army (U22).
army 22 city=33
noarmy 23 24
# Richmond starts the scenario with a fort of level 1. Here it has none, so two can be built.
fort 0 33
